@startuml
title Tic Tac Toe - State Machine

[*] --> ACTIVE : TicTacToeGame\ncreated

ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : handleAction(PlayerAction)\n[validateAction() passes,\nno winner, board not full]\n/ activePlayerId switches (X ↔ O)\n/ moveCount++

ACTIVE --> WIN : handleAction(PlayerAction)\n[3 in a row detected]

ACTIVE --> DRAW : handleAction(PlayerAction)\n[moveCount == 9,\nno winner]

WIN --> [*] : getGameUpdate()\n[GameStatus.WIN]
DRAW --> [*] : getGameUpdate()\n[GameStatus.DRAW]

note right of ACTIVE
  handleAction() is rejected if
  validateAction() returns
  ValidationResult { valid: false }
end note

@enduml